==Dungeon denizens==
The Armory, the center-right entrance, consists of five sections: the [[Training Grounds]]; the [[Footman's Armory]]; the [[Crusader's Armory]]; the [[Warehouse]] and the boss [[Armory Quartermaster Daghelm]]; and the [[Hall of Champions]] with the boss [[Herod]].   
